=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>(被动)[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，装备塔罗之语[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">审判者的救赎</span>]时，攻击前，对目标额外触发该[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">塔罗之语技能</span>]。<br />✦装备塔罗之语[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">审判者的救赎</span>]时，攻击时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，若目标剩余[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"属性增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">属性增益</font></span></span>]数（需可驱散）小于等于3时，攻击、伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">6%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">审判</font></span></span>]系列的目标时，攻击额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>(被动)[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，装备塔罗之语[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">审判者的救赎</span>]时，攻击前，对目标额外触发该[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">塔罗之语技能</span>]。<br />✦装备塔罗之语[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">审判者的救赎</span>]时，攻击时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">16%</font>，若目标剩余[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"属性增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">属性增益</font></span></span>]数（需可驱散）小于等于3时，攻击、伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦攻击拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">审判</font></span></span>]系列的目标时，攻击额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">8%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"信仰之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/40px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/60px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cf/jx6mev9riesiu122xg51bhx9q2zt5qx.png/80px-%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patc